{"3529330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Gallery", "steam_appid": 3529330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [3620450], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Gallery</i>, a mysterious first-person puzzle adventure where every painting hides a secret. Navigate two eerie galleries, each containing eight rooms filled with mind-bending puzzles, cryptic clues, and interactive artwork. To progress, you must decipher riddles, manipulate paintings, and uncover hidden patterns to unlock the next door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no time limits, an immersive ambient soundtrack, and a unique collectible system, <i>The Gallery </i>offers a relaxed yet thought-provoking experience. Observe, experiment, and solve—can you uncover the gallery’s ultimate mystery?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖼️ <strong>Painting-Based Puzzles</strong> – Change, rearrange, and decode artwork to solve intricate riddles.<br>🔎 <strong>Interactive Environment</strong> – Pull levers, rotate paintings, and manipulate objects to unlock secrets.<br>🎵 <strong>Atmospheric Soundtrack</strong> – A haunting yet relaxing ambiance enhances the experience.<br>📜 <strong>Collectibles &amp; Hidden Clues</strong> – Find and display artifacts that reveal more about the gallery.<br>🚶 <strong>Explore at Your Own Pace</strong> – No timers, just a deep dive into the world of art and mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and prepare to unlock the secrets of <i>The Gallery</i>!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Gallery</i>, a mysterious first-person puzzle adventure where every painting hides a secret. Navigate two eerie galleries, each containing eight rooms filled with mind-bending puzzles, cryptic clues, and interactive artwork. To progress, you must decipher riddles, manipulate paintings, and uncover hidden patterns to unlock the next door.</p><p cl